    {
      "id": "f0647880-f657-4d35-af4d-f44df007e740",
      "title": "Resumo rápido da experiência",
      "description": "<p>Uma pessoa pede um resumo profissional curto, e a outra responde com função anterior, mudança de área e aprendizado principal.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Cómo resumirías tu experiencia profesional?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Como você resumiria sua experiência profissional?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/e059b8917f6a4e1883bdd584679b62e0_b07-linea-01-como-resumirias-tu-experiencia-profesional.mp3?Expires=1794099799&Signature=03tUJYBrwrsDXNaWyUTzD2upPTKgRoH530FSnn0GRYhmliB~nVel8VUD26dECYZ0sLAU87TtGcbPrJqOn2eDotrlHMugHNykOkxZMCS97FsDBMwJMFNGycw-7cI5Li1UFvI0jvS7VGjEU4Oc6ymrum2x8Iz8tibYyEqyVmU2biMMMXFAc4t7dsrSm2aQnf2ZY7LmOH~lbHneOiFbUin1Rz71kl3im0UxnQyEFsJwVm8ZUJvYYJVkegLd0C-HF13jTxsMc2zGx0lCLlq20N2cX~5fF4CvGe30P4ii6FoXb5fJ1oH9xwsdTvsZVUlSHkGXS81vMbdLaFqyqm9dwU52pA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Trabajé cinco años en atención al cliente y después pasé al área de operaciones.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Trabalhei cinco anos em atendimento ao cliente e depois passei para a área de operações.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/dbca5a3692a84bd788e1bb0668ab75ce_b07-linea-02-trabaje-cinco-anos-y-despues-pase.mp3?Expires=1794099799&Signature=xqStwdyJZf2qR62WnAXf9nm-iL7CIkw2YO0B-3VfxMBYV5ZcgSMO60~LkTEBB7-m3Sg-N9WRSJmIauNdFWKH95mMpxBkn9sXpQlnuKzG-gJemt870Or-MzwzO37I50fmnA4aZg9zfIG1oDVVhLmvTWmWmFp33rIp7cxzAbxP4cgiQZQq4UKhDE-uTTn2Ku6xYOuqQQrjSsdf6SGhH3OHcIPavKqSE6yXyUILByXaRlEA7lWw-HVtoHmGmdc2Av3~XL6J1NoNgBa82MPkHeseSdf00d~eJfAlOjnwgFqTX4VgHeerllLpFLSrOs9aad89Jwceltkzc7A7YkCmIymE-g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Y qué aprendiste allí?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">E o que você aprendeu ali?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/561b389a98dc404984edd1af4cf52cd4_b07-linea-03-y-que-aprendiste-alli.mp3?Expires=1794099799&Signature=SSXH6q0XbBupj86GFokssUmJndZC0W-xTb9GzXHNlQz1THrnAIJQWU2URZuBbGXXWvhwfWhcyAXYdUccUGNDt5md21FJCzGTbBvhstBVA8asiz5-eJFqadGbwVv8AaT7c5DCgqSB8T2KHYBu2PCmgFHVP3NRzxEEZFdQEXh0RvdgsMdrW51aRLOcxtnS0LMyc9uMFywp04N7ICaLc7L7HD1dcHMIuA4xbupc~eqtEGqQ7Hk2woeN9vy7VHvZVPdT~H2WMDsCkhWwWPSuhFo3JXrBGd6fgSQc9c9LSTiQ5XirvOihkinphEkKQX7IjGjK1RXOvQh92VDJ5pXeLIZVdA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Allí aprendí a coordinar equipos pequeños.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Ali aprendi a coordenar equipes pequenas.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/33ccfafaa4074ad0a83d4c6919de70fa_b07-linea-04-alli-aprendi-a-coordinar-equipos-pequenos.mp3?Expires=1794099799&Signature=Dt5uNJUt7AeutsEE6OSOxGTRyEI0QAv3050acptANYJGYgy52w5jaKOThBs-slTqaOHpHlEzT3XOnSokiAGzcL-6iwacwtHV4XDOWqYxi6Z3twV5a-jsLb1Eyfo-Vz1RTmbSMudrqsCY9plFGvx5KNbyU1wFMqOIoTqZq24wL1LbP-kAdQV5YM~CGeiFgFtJz89zt8et4uscE1PZDuz1XLsSDvkUuJ00-yMQjE7bIMWsoy3nMse8p9vnRBs1ja1dzJUuhlsq4M0gPXcRhCUmehqgRz5AEopPiYDCy-56YHVsjJnCPzoCh0YqsRLka4wHxsUKe0pFOshmWO0dPs9uOw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
